11
00:54:18,750 --> 00:54:24,750
Barbie: Princess Charm School is a 2011 animated fantasy film directed by Zeke Norton, written by Elise Allen, and
produced by Mattel Entertainment (under the name of Barbie Entertainment) with Rainmaker Entertainment.

12
00:59:15,000 --> 00:59:21,000
It was released on DVD on September 13, 2011, and made its
television debut on Nickelodeon two months later.

13
01:04:11,250 --> 01:04:17,250
The twentieth installment in the Barbie film series, the plot follows Blair Willows, a teenage girl living in the kingdom of Gardania,
who wins an annual lottery to attend a prestigious school where girls can train to become princesses or royal ladies.

14
01:09:07,500 --> 01:09:13,500
As Blair learns the ways of being a proper princess, she uncovers the mystery
and secrets behind the kingdom's missing heiress to the throne.

15
01:14:03,750 --> 01:14:09,750
The film explores themes of princess, based on toy,
school, female protagonist, 3d animation.
